	(text "USB MODE switch (74HC4052D U9, S3 = GND), as megafrank:\n  RUN (S0=0): RP2350 USB -> MW7211A hub upstream (USB-A sheet). RP2350 is USB host: keyboard/mouse/gamepad on USB-A.\n  PC  (S0=1): RP2350 USB -> USB-C. PC sees the RP2350 (BOOTSEL flashing / CDC console).\nJP2 \"USB Debug\" forces PC mode with S5 not fitted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 212.71 167.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "06738520-fb69-4653-8afe-53feb8187bb8")
	)
	(text "USB-C: power input (5V) + data.  CC 5.1K = sink.  22R + USBLC6 ESD.\nVBUS_USB goes to the Power sheet (PTC + auto source select)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 118.11 48.26 0)
		(effects
